  "description": "The Porter 16 is built for kids who are ready to ride further, faster, and with more confidence. With its larger 16-inch wheels and a frame inspired by mountain bike geometry, it strikes the perfect balance between stability and agility, giving young riders the freedom to explore beyond the sidewalk.\nEvery detail has been designed with growing cyclists in mind. Tektro mechanical disc brakes deliver powerful, predictable stopping performance, while the levers are shaped and tuned specifically for smaller hands. A clever nylon strap system secures the handlebar in the event of a fall, and the practical kickstand makes everyday use effortless.\nSmooth-rolling wheels with sealed bearing hubs ensure durability and easy pedaling across a variety of surfaces. Whether on neighborhood rides, family adventures, or first ventures onto dirt paths, the Porter 16 is built to keep up.\nFinished in a refined steel blue colorway, the Porter 16 combines toughness with understated style—making it a bike that kids will love to ride and parents will be proud to see in action.\nThe Porter 16 isn’t just about size—it’s about progression. It’s the trusted step that helps kids grow into confident, capable riders.",
